# Public build defaults so the map works on a fresh deploy without dashboard setup.
# Both values are public by design: the anon key is embedded in the client bundle
# of every Supabase app, and Row Level Security is what actually protects the
# data (anon can read published lots/geometry only — never buyer PII).
#
# Anything set in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables overrides these.
# SECRETS DO NOT BELONG HERE: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, RESEND_API_KEY and
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY must be set as Vercel env vars.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://otkqzrcuuafjdaxjeyvx.supabase.co
